<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2PETULO</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWA IKABILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PETULO</para>
  <para style="toc2">2PETULO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pet.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWA IKABILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETULO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili lwa ikabili lwa Petulo lolonga kamba lwandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Petulo. Yodahika kamba munhu iyagwe iyo yandike sama ya Petulo. Yandike lupwilili luno kolonga kamba heyo kakala msindila wa ukazi wa Yesu na ng'haning'hani haja lukuli kihanga chake vikigaluke (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">1:17-18</ref></char>). Ihawa Petulo kandika yodahika kamba lupwilili luno lwandikigwa madiwambo da Loma hagatigati ya milao ya 65-69 songela viyavumbuke Kilisto, kipigiti yang'hali hanadanganhika. Vivija Petulo kolukema lupwilili lwake lwa ikabili (3:1) na kwika zua da kwandika lupwilili luno songela viyeshile kwandika lupwilili lwa ichanduso lwa Petulo. Lupwilili luno kawandikila wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Petulo kandika lupwilili luno giladi yawagangamize wanhu wamtogole Kilisto kukala ukazi unogile na kuwazuma waleke kuwinza mafundo ga uvwizi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref></char>). Kawagangamiza kuwazabuza wanhu awo wolonga kamba Yesu kokawa kubwele. Ila kalagusa kamba Mulungu hakawa ila kolonda kila munhu yakomboligwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:8-9">3:8-9</ref></char>). Kino kicho kilamso cha kukala ukazi unogile (3:14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Petulo kokiitambula mwenyego na kuwalagusa wasomaji zake (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho kowakumbusa kukala ukazi unogile kwavija Mulungu kotutenda tudahe kukala ukazi uwo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 1:3-21">1:3-21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho kolava nzumo mmbuli ya wakulufunzi wa uvwizi na kulonga kija chondakiwalawilile mkipigiti cha ikimambukizo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abaho Petulo komambukiza mkuwagangamiza wanhu wamtogole Kilisto kukala ukazi unogile kuitanda na vija Yesu vondayabwele mwanza wa ikabili (<char style="ior"><ref loc="2PE 3:1-17">3:1-17</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Simoni Petulo, nyakadala na mtumigwa wa Yesu Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Nowandikila wanhu wagweleligwe nhamanila ili na ugoli mkulu kamba nhamanila itulinayo tweye kubitila kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kualinao Mulungu wetu na Mkombola wetu Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="2PE 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Ngekewa na tindiwalo viwe bwando kumwenu kubitila ilimu yenu ya mkumtanga Mulungu na Mndewa wetu Yesu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Msaguligwa na Kukemigwa na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Mhiko zake Mulungu zitugwelela kila kinhu kitulonda giladi tukale ukazi wa kumtamanila Mulungu kubitila ilimu yetu ya kumtanga heyo yatukemile tweye giladi twingile kuiyenzi yake na muunovu wake. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Kubitila gano katugwelela vilagano vake vikulu ng'hani na vinogile viyailagane na tweye, giladi kubitila vilagano hivo mwinege na sulukila zihile za ugoni zigala ubananzi zili muulumwengu, na mwize kuwa wanhu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="2PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Sama ya kilamso kino, muiyohe ng'hani kongeza unovu muinhamanila yenu. Muunovu wenu yongezeni na ilimu, <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>muilimu yenu yongezeni na kuizuila, mkuizuila kumwenu yongezeni na mwazaganyo, mmwazaganyo wenu yongezeni na kumtanga Mulungu, <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>na vija vimumtanga Mulungu yongezeni na noge da udugu wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, na mdinoge da udugu wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto yongezeni na noge. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Kwavija kamba muhawa navo vinhu vino na kongezeka mmwanza wenu, vowatenda mweye muwe wasang'hana na kuleka kulela mujo muilimu yenu ya kumtanga Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Ila munhu yalibule vinhu hivo halola kutali ama kimbugumbugu, na kaisemwa kamba kesha kasuluzwa vilozo vake va umwaka.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, iyoheni ng'hani kulagusa kamba mweye kweli mwa mmwanza wa wanhu mkemigwe na kusaguligwa na Mulungu. Zitendeni mbuli zino, na mweye hamuileka nhamanila yenu. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Kwavija mkutenda vino, motogozigwa kwingila Muundewa wa digunge wa Mndewa na Mkombola wetu Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Avo, mazua gose nowakumbusa mbuli zino, hata kamba mwisha kuzitanga na kuigoga ng'hani ikweli imuibokele. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Nokona vinoga kuwakumbusa mbuli zino kipigiti ning'hali mgima. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Kwavija novitanga kamba na mmabehi kudanganhika, kamba vija Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto viyanilongele. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Avo, nokiiyoha ng'hani kuwatendela nzila giladi mzikumbukile mbuli zino mkipigiti chose nihesha kudanganhika.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tuyona Yenzi ya Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Hatuuwinzile usheha utungigwe na wanhu wabala kipigiti vituwalongele mmbuli ya mhiko na kwiza kwa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto. Ila tuyona yenzi yake na meso getu wenyego. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>Kwavija kapata hishima na yenzi kulawa ha Mulungu Tata kipigiti dizwi vudimwizile kulawa muna Iyenzi Ng'hulu, ilonga, “Ino iyo Mwanangu mnogelwa, ninogelwa nayo!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 17:5">MATAYO 17:5</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 9:7">MALUKO 9:7</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:35">LUKA 9:35</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Tweye wenyego tudihulika dizwi dino dilawilile kuulanga kipigiti vitukalile na heyo hana ikigongo king'alile.<verse eid="2PE 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Tweye tuna usenga wa wahokozi ututenda tweye tugangamale. Na mweye motenda goya muhautegeleza, kwavija ulinga kamba kiwenge kimulika mdiziza mbaka imitondo, na Kilisto iyo Nhondo ya Imitondo imwemwesa mmioyo yenu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Uhaleka gano gose, molondigwa m'vitange kamba haduhu uhokozi wa Nyandiko Zing'alile wizile kulawa mzinzonzi za muhokozi mwenyego. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Kwavija haduhu uhokozi uhokoligwa kamba voyolonda munhu, ila wanhu wowa hasi ya udaho wa Loho wa Mulungu kipigiti viwoulonga usenga ulawa ha Mulungu.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Wakulufunzi wa Uvwizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Ila vivija kukala na wahokozi wa uvwizi mmwanza wa wanhu wa umwaka, kamba vija vondakuwe na wakulufunzi wa uvwizi mmwanza wenu. Mkuifisa wofundiza mafundo ga uvwizi, hata kum'bela Mndewa yawagulile, na kuigalila wenyego ubananzi wa kusinhukiza. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Hata avo, wanhu bwando woziwinza mbuli zao zihile, na sama ya mbuli zowotenda, wanhu wayagwe woilonga vihile nzila ya ikweli. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Muisulukila ya kuilundikizila vinhu iwalinayo, wakulufunzi wano wa uvwizi wowabulunya mweye kubitila usheha wa uvwizi. Nhaguso yao isha kupetigwa songela mwaka, na hewo hawakawa kubanangigwa.<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Kwavija Mulungu hawonele bazi wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga viwatendile vilozo, ila kawasa kuzimu, kawafunga minyolo, na kuwagela mdiziza kulu wobeta zua da nhaguso. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>Mulungu hawonele bazi ulumwengu wa umwaka, ila kagala mmemelo wa mazi mwa wanhu walekile kumtogola Mulungu, ila Nuhu yeiyeka iyo yakomboligwe, ayo yapetile mbuli ya kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, na wanhu wayagwe saba. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Mulungu kaitagusa miwambo ya Sodoma na Gomola mkuigela moto mbaka kuwa mitozi, na kuitenda iwe kilingilo cha kija chondakiwalawilile Wamhazi. <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Mulungu kamkombola Loti, munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye, yageligwe giogio kulu na sang'hano zihile za wanhu wehile wamzunguluke. <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Loti, munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye, kakala hagatigati yao, na zua dimwe mbaka zua diyagwe kagaya ng'hani mmoyo wake viyaziwene na kuzihulika sang'hano zao zihile. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Avo, Mndewa kovitanga vija vondayawakombole wanhu zake kulawa mmigayo na vija vondayawasune wanhu watendile gehile mbaka zua da nhaguso, <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>ng'haning'hani wanhu waja wowinza sulukila zao zihile za lukuli na kuuzabuza udaho wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Wakulufunzi wano wa uvwizi woitopa na kuigoda, na hawalagusa hishima ha vinhu vilumbigwe na Mulungu vili na yenzi vili uchana. Ila woviliga. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Hata wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, awo wali na mhiko ng'hani na udaho mkulu kubanza wakulufunzi wano wa uvwizi, hawavitagusa vinhu hivo vilumbigwe mkuvilonga vihile haulongozi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Ila wanhu wano wokala mkuwinza nzoela zao, walinga kamba wang'onyo wa kumuhulo woleligwa giladi wagogigwe na kukomigwa. Wokivamhila na kukilonga vihile kinhu chochose walekile kukitanga. Wobanangigwa kamba wang'onyo wa kumuhulo. <verse eid="2PE 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>Wolihigwa migayo sama ya imigayo iwasongeze. Hewo wonogelwa kutenda kinhu chochose hauhalangwe mkipigiti cha imisi, kinhu chondakizigutize sulukila za ng'huli zao. Wogela kinyala na kugela nyela viwoilumba hamoja na mweye kuja mandia genu, kuno wose wodeng'hela nzila zao za uvwizi. <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Wotenda ugoni na meso gao, na sulukila yao ya kutenda vilozo haimala. Wowaswagiza wanhu wali na nhamanila ndodo watende vilozo, na wafundizigwa goya muisulukila ya kuilundikizila vinhu. Wokala hasi ya ndukumiza ya Mulungu. <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Waileka nzila igoloke, watenda mbuli zihile mkuiwinza nzila ya Balaamu mwana wa Beoli, ayo yanogelwe na maliho ga sang'hano zihile. <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>Ila Balaamu kakomhokelwa na mhunda wake sama ya mbuli zake zihile. Mhunda kalonga na dizwi da kiunhu na kumtenda Balaamu yaleke mbuli zake za ubozi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli za Balaamu zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 22:4-35">MHETA 22:4-35</ref></char>.</note> <figure style="fig" alt="Balaam on donkey" file="BalaamOnDonkey_Num22.21-30_CO00867.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="2:16">Balaamu na Mhunda</figure><verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Wanhu wano wawa kamba nzokwe zilibule mazi na kungugu dihembelusigwa na kukuzumbi. Ziza kulu dikigwa sama yao. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Kwavija wokiitopa na kulonga mbuli za ubozi, na kubitila sulukila zao zihile za lukuli wowanamata waja wasongile kunyelenhuka mkipigiti kiguhi kulawa ha wanhu wokala ukazi wa kutenda mbuli zihile. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Wowekila kilagano cha kuilegeha, kuno hewo wenyego wao nyakadala wa mbuli zihile. Kwavija munhu kowa nyakadala wa kinhu chochose kimtawala. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Kwavija ihawa wazikimbila mbuli zihile za ulumwengu kubitila ilimu ya kumtanga Mndewa na Mkombola wetu Yesu Kilisto, abaho wahanamatwa na kuhumigwa na hewo, kimambukizo cha wanhu wano chokwiha ng'hani kubanza vija viwakalile haichanduso. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Vihanogile kumwao sambiwaitange nzila ilibule uzenzeleganye, kubanza kuitanga, abaho kuileka ija indagizi ing'alile iwagweleligwe. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>Ilawilila kumwao kamba vija ulonzi wa ikweli ulonga, “Umbwa koibwelela midesi yake mwenyego,” na “Mtumbi yogezwe kobweleganya kubimbilika muna imitope.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Kilagano cha Kwiza Mndewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Mbwiga zangu, luno lulo lupwilili lwangu lwa ikabili kumwenu. Mmhwilili zose mbili nigeza kuzilamusa ngelegeza zenu na kuwakumbusa mbuli zino. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Nolonda mkumbuke mbuli zija zilongigwe umwaka na wahokozi wang'alile, na ija indagizi ya Mndewa na Mkombola wetu imgweleligwe mweye na watumigwa wa Kilisto wali kumwenu. <verse eid="2PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Tanhu m'vitange kamba mmazua ga kimambukizo wanhu wene mzihaka wolawilila. Woiponeza ikweli na kuwinza sulukila zao wenyego. <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>Na hewo wolonga, “Kailagana namwe kamba kokwiza, ama vilihi? Kakwahi? Wahenga zetu wesha kudanganhika, ila kila kinhu kisigala vivija kamba vikikalile haichanduso songela ulumwengu viulumbigwe!” <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Ila mkutenda giladi waileka ikweli kamba umwaka Mulungu kalava ndagizi, na ulanga na isi vilumbigwa. Isi ilumbigwa kulawa mmazi na izungulukwa na mazi, <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>na kubitila mmemelo wa mazi higo, ulumwengu wa kipigiti kija ukululigwa na kubanangigwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Ila mmbuli iija ulanga uno wa sambi na isi ino ya sambi vikigwa sama ya moto, vikigwa mbaka zua dija da nhaguso na ubananzi wa wanhu walekile kumtamanila Mulungu.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Ila mbwiga zangu, sambimuisemwe mbuli ino, kamba ha Mndewa zua dimwe kamba milao alufu imwe, na milao alufu imwe kamba zua dimwe. <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Mndewa hakawa kukivikiza kilagano chake kamba wayagwe vowogelegeza. Ila kowazaganya mweye, kwavija halonda munhu yoyose yapotele, ila kila munhu yaleke vilozo vake.<verse eid="2PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Ila Zua da Mndewa dokwiza kamba m'bavi. Ulanga wosegela na kidinhilo kikulu, na vinhu vili mgati yake vobanangigwa mkulukuzwa na moto, na isi yosegela hamoja na vinhu vose vili mgati yake. <verse eid="2PE 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Kwavija kila kinhu chobanangigwa kamba vino, molondigwa kuwa wanhu wa vilihi? Molondigwa kukala ukazi ung'alile na wa kumtamanila Mulungu, <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>kipigiti vumdibeta Zua dondayeze Mulungu, na tendeni vija vimdaha kuditenda dize mbwisa, zua dondadiutende ulanga usomigwe na moto na kubanangigwa, na vinhu va kuulanga volumbuka na moto. <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Ila tweye tololela uulanga wa sambi na iisi ya sambi viyailagane na tweye, ulumwengu umemile kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kuyalinako Mulungu.<verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Avo, mbwiga zangu, kipigiti vumbeta mbuli zino, tendeni vumdaha giladi muwe wanhu wang'alile na mulibule nyela hameso ga Mulungu na muwe na tindiwalo na heyo. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Uloleni mwazaganyo wa Mndewa wetu kamba nafasi yowagwelela mweye mdahe kukomboligwa, kamba vija ndugu yetu Paulo viyawandikile na ng'hungwe ziyagweleligwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Kokwandika vivo mzimhwilili zake zose, yolonga mbuli zino mgati yake. Mzimhwilili zake hana mbuli ziyagwe ndala kuzitanga, na wanhu wabozi na walekile kwima goya wozipeta vihile, kamba viwozipeta Mzinyandiko ziyagwe Zing'alile. Avo woigalila wenyego ubananzi.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Avo, mbwiga zangu, sambi mwisha kuitanga mbuli ino, avo teganyeni giladi sambimsoligwe na ubananzi wa wanhu wotenda gehile na kulagala kulawa hanhu henu hanogile hamuli. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Ila mgendelele kukula mngekewa na ilimu ya kumtanga Mndewa na Mkombola wetu Yesu Kilisto. Yenzi iwe kumwake, kulawa sambi na digunge! Amina.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
